ALBUKHR A2U Cross-System Review Pack v1.3
Matsayi: REVIEW ONLY — ba a shirya yin apply/deploy ba.
Wannan siga ta sabunta binciken da aka yi kan ainihin main branch na albukhr-api, albukhr-app, albukhr-admin, da Mainnet Supabase a ranar 17 Oktoba 2026. Ba ta canza GitHub, Supabase, Render ko wani payment ba.
Abin da aka tabbatar
A2U payout service, Pi client, worker da cron entry point suna cikin albukhr-api/main.
src/pi-a2u-client.js yana da source-level hard gate MAINNET_A2U_OFFICIALLY_SUPPORTED = false; wannan dole ne ya ci gaba da kasancewa a kashe.
src/a2u-payout-service.js yana kira da v2 RPC guda huɗu da ba su cikin Mainnet Supabase a yanzu.
/api/pay-withdrawal a src/financial-gateway.js har yanzu yana ɗauke da tsohon payout implementation daban, ba ya amfani da DB fencing/claim v2.
server.js bai mount src/a2u-worker.js ba; render.yaml ba shi da Render Cron service. Ba a ƙara su a wannan review pack ba.
albukhr-app/main yana da href="withdraw.html" a investor-dashboard.html, amma withdraw.html bai bayyana cikin tree na main ba; babu GET /api/withdrawal-history ko get_my_withdrawal_requests caller da aka samu a API repo.
Admin withdrawal UI har yanzu yana amfani da manual Mark as Paid flow bayan saka TXID.
Abubuwan da ke cikin bundle
src/ da scripts/a2u-payout-cron.js: snapshot ɗin A2U safety code da aka yi review, ba sabuwar production activation ba.
tests/: static/model/mock tests.
sql/NOT_READY_DO_NOT_APPLY_20261017_a2u_payout_safety_v3.sql: tsohon SQL draft domin review kawai; an sanya suna da gangan don hana ɗaukar shi a matsayin migration da aka amince da ita.
docs/CURRENT_MAIN_AUDIT_2026-10-17.md: abubuwan da aka tabbatar daga current sources/database.
docs/SQL_REVISION_REQUIRED_HA.md: SQL/admin concurrency blockers kafin a tsara migration ta ƙarshe.
docs/API_AND_UI_GAPS_HA.md: sauran haɗin user-side, admin-side da API.
scripts/verify-current-main-baseline.js: read-only checker don tabbatar da hashes na current API main baseline idan an samu local clone.
scripts/apply-api-single-payout-review.js: dry-run by default; idan an yi review dabam, --apply-local yana canza local checkout files biyu kawai (API gateway da package manifest). Ba ya canza GitHub/DB/Render, kuma ba ya sa A2U ya kunna.
tests/api-single-payout-transform.test.js: synthetic fixture test na gateway transformation; ba full API integration test ba.
Test status
Gwaje-gwajen static, runtime gate, uncertainty mock, da balance model daga wannan bundle sun wuce a Node.js v22.16.0. Waɗannan ba su maye gurbin PostgreSQL/PLpgSQL validation, SQL privilege tests, Pi Testnet integration ko Admin concurrency tests ba.
Haramcin wannan matakin
Kada a gudanar da SQL draft, kada a kunna A2U, kada a haɗa wallet seed, kada a ƙirƙiri Cron service, kada a canza Render env vars, kada a aika Pi, kuma kada a commit/deploy source daga wannan bundle. A2U Mainnet sai bayan Pi ta tabbatar da eligibility/Outgoing Wallet da kuma ALBUKHR ya yi review da amincewa daban.
